      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "The UN is mapped onto the celebratory gathering",
      "description": "The text 'when the un adds another million' is juxtaposed with the visual of a Jewish celebratory gathering. The meme implies that the United Nations (UN) is somehow responsible for 'adding' to the Holocaust death toll, thereby mapping the UN onto the celebratory scene as if the gathering represents the UN's actions or presence. This is a hateful misrepresentation that falsely equates the UN with the Holocaust's perpetuation.",
